      "uid": "zhcn:966a55d1d25ef62195471bec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我有模有样地高举起手，\n做出从天空摘下星星的动作，\n把星形胸针放到手掌心──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66e4378247bcf79cbaef909bb1ad4e9c37137e79ce5cf2a087c913de07f9191",
